Package: querencia-benachrichtigungen
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: querencia-session
Provides: notification-daemon
Description: Querencia Desktop notification service (alpha)
 Querencia Benachrichtigungen implements org.freedesktop.Notifications
 for Querencia Desktop and shows notifications as popups in the top
 right corner (gtk4-layer-shell), with actions and images.
 .
 It is started by the Querencia session (querencia-session); the package
 installs no D-Bus activation file, so other desktops keep their own
 notification service.
 The interface is English with a German translation (gettext).
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
